ich can be very beneficial if used well by the player. You can also think of this game as a bullet hell, but in 3d.\n\nOne thing I am going to say about this game though is the really mediocre optimization. Devs stated that they are going to deal with it, but for now, get a decent computer.\n\nGrab this game as soon as you can, 9.5/10.", "timestamp_created": 1641512862, "timestamp_updated": 1641512862, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501527488231658936", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107471109", "author": {"steamid": "76561199099327517", "personaname": "Demonia", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DemoniaCait/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 25, "playtime_forever": 2561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 614, "last_played": 1674099313, "avatar": "b26895549ecef44f3013aed417d3a3b3083ec808"}, "language": "english", "review": " i love this game it goes the beep bop", "timestamp_created": 1641499413, "timestamp_updated": 1641499413, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "107430559", "author": {"steamid": "76561198396814154", "personaname": "1 soul roach", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198396814154/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 73, "playtime_forever": 6542, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 212, "last_played": 1737760213, "avatar": "55ce928964147d4241100f8589e80b19f29c8b23"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud",